[{"ave_id":"AVE-2010-0400","file_name":"2010/AVE-2010-0400.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2010-3035","title":"Cisco IOS XR BGP 远程拒绝服务漏洞","description":"Cisco IOS XR 3.4.0 至 3.9.1 版本在启用 BGP 协议时，未能正确处理无法识别的传递属性（transitive attribute）。远程攻击者可通过向目标设备发送特制的 BGP 前缀通告（包含属性类型代码 99）触发该漏洞，导致 BGP 对等会话重置，造成拒绝服务。该漏洞影响运行 Cisco IOS XR 的多种路由设备，CVSS 评分 7.5，危害等级高。Cisco 已发布安全公告修复此漏洞。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.5,"aliases":["CVE-2010-3035"],"sources":["kev"],"published":"2010-08-30T21:00:12Z","updated":"2026-06-16T23:22:00Z","remediation":"升级 Cisco IOS XR 至 3.9.2 或更高版本（该版本包含 CSCti62211 的修复补丁）；在无法立即升级时，可在 BGP 入口策略中配置 route-map 丢弃属性类型码 99 的更新，或使用 `neighbor x.x.x.x filter-list` 配合前缀列表过滤异常 BGP 通告，同时启用 BGP 会话 MD5 认证和 TTL 安全跳数限制缓解风险。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-22T00:00:00Z","references":["http://mailman.nanog.org/pipermail/nanog/2010-August/024837.html","http://osvdb.org/67696","http://secunia.com/advisories/41190","http://www.cisco.com/en/US/products/products_security_advisory09186a0080b4411f.shtml","http://www.securitytracker.com/id?1024371","http://www.vupen.com/english/advisories/2010/2227","https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/61443","https://www.cisa.gov/known-exploited-vulnerabilities-catalog?field_cve=CVE-2010-3035","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/ed228d55b7972f63e700a35a54fbcd94064b9ade/2010/CVE-2010-3035.md","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/362345baaa3b0376b2369a7901885756e250334b/cves/2010/3xxx/CVE-2010-3035.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2010/CVE-2010-3035","https://github.com/cisagov/vulnrichment/blob/f3e6800281dab3089a8374b9fe419c8b8110ea36/2010/3xxx/CVE-2010-3035.json","https://github.com/a-dhaou-tekup/VRA/blob/3e4f21c329250c5eca327489d3fd5be9b398ce7b/data/rag_corpus/cisa_kev_notes/CVE-2010-3035.txt","https://github.com/cyberdudebivash/cyberdudebivash-ai-security-hub/blob/13403e1745f63237e7ef6d51562fb36112320d77/frontend/cve/CVE-2010-3035.html","https://github.