考虑在 IE 中禁用 RealPlayer ActiveX 控件或更换其他媒体播放器作为临时缓解措施。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-27T00:00:00Z","references":["http://secunia.com/advisories/41096","http://secunia.com/advisories/41154","http://service.real.com/realplayer/security/08262010_player/en/","http://www.securitytracker.com/id?1024370","http://www.vupen.com/english/advisories/2010/2216","https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/61424","https://oval.cisecurity.org/repository/search/definition/oval%3Aorg.mitre.oval%3Adef%3A7507","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/257ebb29696cc311841c79ca4ceb0162bf5df44a/cves/2010/3xxx/CVE-2010-3001.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2010/CVE-2010-3001","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/c54e59752dddfc9aa36c13774164384cfa0d1f04/content/CVE-2010-3001.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/4bd823fa5ff72ec859371ff3ef0f5e18be2f2c77/CVE/data/2010/CVE-2010-3001.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/29919db3f954d9ce9be0e7e3cf177436392d45d3/advisories/unreviewed/2022/05/GHSA-v53q-gcfp-w2gr/GHSA-v53q-gcfp-w2gr.json","https://github.com/xqcyberscore/nvt/blob/978f6a9acb495d7d669239530ffe6da5d631f4da/2010/gb_realplayer_mult_vuln_win.nasl","https://github.com/blackhook/nessus-plugins/blob/64177d96abbb07c58cf7e131046b067ebc61fcb5/R/realplayer_12_0_0_879.nasl","https://github.com/oasis-open/cti-stix-common-objects/blob/55ba7598cbd5a52577b6887871505d931d85cb61/objects/vulnerability/vulnerability--42870a5d-f472-47dc-a1f8-1a25edfdc5b3.json","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2010/CVE-2010-3001.json","https://github.com/Center-Sun/security-updates.zh-cn/blob/52e7b0ecdcd93c8e9dc03189611bcdf42681e253/security-updates/MicrosoftVulnerabilityInvestigationBulletin/2011/msvr11-003.md"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2010/AVE-2010-0197.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2010-0196","file_name":"2010/AVE-2010-0196.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2010-3000","title":"RealNetworks RealPlayer FLV 解析整数溢出远程代码执行漏洞","description":"RealNetworks RealPlayer 11.0 至 11.1 及 RealPlayer SP 1.0 至 1.1.4（Windows 版）的 ParseKnownType 函数中存在多处整数溢出漏洞。远程攻击者可通过向目标用户发送特制的 FLV 文件，其中包含精心构造的 HX_FLV_META_AMF_TYPE_MIXEDARRAY 或 HX_FLV_META_AMF_TYPE_ARRAY 数据，在解析时触发整数溢出，最终导致任意代码执行。攻击者无需身份认证，但需诱导用户打开恶意文件。该漏洞 CVSS 评分 9.3，危害严重，影响范围广泛。","severity":"CRITICAL","score":9.3,"aliases":["CVE-2010-3000"],"sources":["tenable"],"published":"2010-08-30T20:00:02Z","updated":"2026-06-16T23:21:56Z","remediation":"立即升级 RealPlayer SP 至 12.0.0.879 或更高版本，该版本修复了 FLV 文件解析中的整数溢出漏洞。官方安全公告及下载地址：http://service.real.com/realplayer/security/08262010_player/en/。如无法立即升级，建议禁用浏览器中的 RealPlayer ActiveX 控件，或限制用户对不可信 FLV 文件的访问作为临时缓解措施。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-27T00:00:00Z","references":["http://secunia.com/advisories/41096","http://secunia.com/advisories/41154","http://service.real.com/realplayer/security/08262010_player/en/","http://www.securityfocus.com/archive/1/513383/100/0/threaded","http://www.securitytracker.com/id?1024370","http://www.vupen.com/english/advisories/2010/2216","http://www.zerodayinitiative.com/advisories/ZDI-10-167","https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/61423","https://oval.cisecurity.org/repository/search/definition/oval%3Aorg.mitre.oval%3Adef%3A6651","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/14992","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/257ebb29696cc311841c79ca4ceb0162bf5df44a/cves/2010/3xxx/CVE-2010-3000.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2010/CVE-2010-3000","https://github.com/vulncheck-oss/0day.today.archive/blob/3664abdd71985a44aff3260896a8f36e2f4a9682/dos-poc/14068.txt","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/c54e59752dddfc9aa36c13774164384cfa0d1f04/content/CVE-2010-30