 RealPlayer 11.0 至 11.1 及 RealPlayer SP 1.0 至 1.1.4 在 Windows 平台上处理 QCP 音频内容时存在堆缓冲区溢出漏洞。远程攻击者可通过构造包含超大尺寸值的恶意 QCP 音频文件，诱导用户播放触发堆溢出，进而在用户上下文中执行任意代码。该漏洞影响 Windows 平台上的 RealPlayer 多个版本，CVSS 评分 9.3（AV:N/AC:M/Au:N/C:C/I:C/A:C），攻击向量为网络、攻击复杂度中等、无需身份认证、机密性/完整性/可用性均完全受损。攻击者需诱导受害者打开恶意 QCP 文件或访问嵌入恶意 QCP 内容的网页，利用方式为构造畸形 QCP 文件触发堆溢出实现远程代码执行。RealNetworks 已在 RealPlayer SP 12.0.0.879 及更高版本中修复该漏洞。","severity":"CRITICAL","score":9.3,"aliases":["CVE-2010-0120"],"sources":["tenable"],"published":"2010-08-30T20:00:01Z","updated":"2026-06-16T23:15:31Z","remediation":"建议立即升级 RealPlayer 至 SP 12.0.0.879 或更高版本（官网下载最新版）。若暂时无法升级，建议在浏览器中禁用 RealPlayer ActiveX 插件（IE 管理加载项中禁用 RealPlayer Browser Record Plugin 等），并禁止打开不可信的 .qcp 文件作为临时缓解措施。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-25T00:00:00Z","references":["http://secunia.com/advisories/41096","http://secunia.com/advisories/41154","http://secunia.com/secunia_research/2010-8/","http://service.real.com/realplayer/security/08262010_player/en/","http://www.securitytracker.com/id?1024370","http://www.vupen.com/english/advisories/2010/2216","https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/61422","https://oval.cisecurity.org/repository/search/definition/oval%3Aorg.mitre.oval%3Adef%3A6807","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/e0d4b639863e3178ba8dc8b525356f8aab24b9da/cves/2010/0xxx/CVE-2010-0120.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2010/CVE-2010-0120","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/7c450063cd3f12f7aa97a070bb18c68d6bc6767e/content/CVE-2010-0120.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/68f4381f2016d51eca45695265af085374593db5/CVE/data/2010/CVE-2010-0120.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/fb70ff2c257f1ca47c72f5b8b5d913d0de6cca53/advisories/unreviewed/2022/05/GHSA-9h27-8cv4-44j6/GHSA-9h27-8cv4-44j6.json","https://github.com/xqcyberscore/nvt/blob/978f6a9acb495d7d669239530ffe6da5d631f4da/2010/gb_realplayer_mult_vuln_