控制目标系统。","severity":"CRITICAL","score":9.3,"aliases":["CVE-2010-0116"],"sources":["tenable"],"published":"2010-08-30T20:00:01Z","updated":"2026-06-16T23:15:30Z","remediation":"建议立即升级 RealPlayer 至 SP 12.0.0.879 或更高版本（访问 real.com 下载最新版）。若无法立即升级，建议卸载 RealPlayer 或在受信任环境中禁用 QCP 文件关联，禁止打开不可信的 .qcp 文件，并在防火墙层面限制 RealPlayer 进程的网络访问作为临时缓解措施。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-25T00:00:00Z","references":["http://secunia.com/advisories/41096","http://secunia.com/advisories/41154","http://secunia.com/secunia_research/2010-3/","http://service.real.com/realplayer/security/08262010_player/en/","http://www.securitytracker.com/id?1024370","http://www.vupen.com/english/advisories/2010/2216","https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/61420","https://oval.cisecurity.org/repository/search/definition/oval%3Aorg.mitre.oval%3Adef%3A7326","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/e0d4b639863e3178ba8dc8b525356f8aab24b9da/cves/2010/0xxx/CVE-2010-0116.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2010/CVE-2010-0116","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/7c450063cd3f12f7aa97a070bb18c68d6bc6767e/content/CVE-2010-0116.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/68f4381f2016d51eca45695265af085374593db5/CVE/data/2010/CVE-2010-0116.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/fb70ff2c257f1ca47c72f5b8b5d913d0de6cca53/advisories/unreviewed/2022/05/GHSA-q3x6-x3m5-f2j3/GHSA-q3x6-x3m5-f2j3.json","https://github.com/xqcyberscore/nvt/blob/978f6a9acb495d7d669239530ffe6da5d631f4da/2010/gb_realplayer_mult_vuln_win.nasl","https://github.com/intSpLoiT/intframework/blob/eabaa799d0260aa52b735fa9769266d1ce4b64ef/modules/cve_list.txt","https://github.com/KTZgraph/sarenka/blob/f1fb931ab722d6c096d581ed6e3c5966d799fbaa/sarenka/feeds/cve_details/cve_all_details_112700_112800.json","https://github.com/oasis-open/cti-stix-common-objects/blob/55ba7598cbd5a52577b6887871505d931d85cb61/objects/vulner